  "description": {
   "en": "Former pro boxer Harima Ryo plunges into a two-year vegetative state after a fateful match. When he awakens, he’s met with the crushing end of his athletic career, his father’s death, and ruthless betrayal by the gym he once called home. Consumed by rage and grief, Harima vows to claw his way back into the boxing world, not as a fighter, but as a promoter, manipulating the sport’s shadowy underbelly to seize power and profit.\n\nA raw, unflinching tale of those who thrive in boxing’s darkest corners. A place where fists forge legacies, money fuels corruption, and survival demands bending the rules."
  },
